    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rituals dont really help though. it just feels like im waiting for something that isnt ever coming back. the world just keeps moving but i feel stuck in this silence. honestly it feels like everything is just... pointless. like why am i even trying to keep going when the only thing that made me happy is gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
