    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want a \"gentle change in routine.\" i just want the feeling to go away. everything feels so meaningless now. it's like i'm just a ghost in this house. sometimes i think maybe it would be easier if i just wasn't here to feel the silence anymore. does that even make sense? that it just seems better to just... stop?",
